# CR 702.16c, 702.16j, 704.5m: a player with protection from everything can't be enchanted by any Aura, their own included,
# and an Aura attached to them goes to its owner's graveyard as a state-based action. Bot1 enchants itself with its own Curse
# of Opulence on turn 1 and Bot2 enchants Bot1 with another on turn 2; both are still attached as Bot1's turn 3 begins (the
# positive control). Bot1 casts The One Ring: once its trigger gives Bot1 protection from everything, both Curses go to
# their owners' graveyards.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Curse of Opulence
The One Ring
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Curse of Opulence
Island x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Curse of Opulence.Cast(Bot1)
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Curse of Opulence.Cast(Bot1)
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Curse of Opulence.AttachedTo = Bot1
? Bot2.Battlefield.Curse of Opulence.AttachedTo = Bot1
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.The One Ring.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Mountain; The One Ring; Mox Pearl; Mox Sapphire; Mox Jet; Mox Emerald
Bot1.Graveyard = Curse of Opulence
Bot2.Battlefield = Mountain
Bot2.Graveyard = Curse of Opulence
